## Project Structure Guide

- **App Router (Next.js)**: Source of routes and pages lives in `app/`.
  - Layout and global styles: `app/layout.tsx`, `app/globals.css`
  - Landing page: `app/page.tsx`
  - Route groups include `app/auth/*`, `app/search/*`, `app/share/*`, and API handlers under `app/api/*`.

- **APIs**: Implemented with Next.js Route Handlers under `app/api/`.
  - Notable subtrees: `advanced-search/`, `chat/`, `chats/`, `config/`, `ollama/`.

- **UI Components**: Reusable components live in `components/`.
  - UI primitives in `components/ui/*` (shadcn/ui style)
  - Chat experience in `components/chat*.tsx`, `components/answer-section.tsx`, `components/retrieve-section.tsx`
  - Artifacts and tool outputs under `components/artifact/*`

- **Domain Logic / Libraries**: In `lib/`.
  - **Agents**: `lib/agents/*`
  - **Streaming**: `lib/streaming/*`
  - **Tools**: `lib/tools/*`
  - **Auth**: `lib/auth/*`
  - **Config**: `lib/config/*`
  - **Types/Utils**: `lib/types/*`, `lib/utils/*`

- **Configuration**
  - Next config: [next.config.mjs](mdc:next.config.mjs)
  - TypeScript: [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json)
  - Package: [package.json](mdc:package.json)
  - Tailwind: [tailwind.config.ts](mdc:tailwind.config.ts)
  - PostCSS: [postcss.config.mjs](mdc:postcss.config.mjs)
  - App settings docs: [docs/CONFIGURATION.md](mdc:docs/CONFIGURATION.md)

- **Static/Public Assets**: `public/`
  - Images and provider icons in `public/images/*`, `public/providers/*`
  - App-config JSON under `public/config/*`

- **Server Middleware**: `middleware.ts` (auth, rewrites, headers as needed)

### Conventions
- Prefer colocating route-specific components under the route directory.
- Shared UI in `components/`, shared logic in `lib/`.
- Keep API input/output types in `lib/types/` when shared across client and server.

